# Evidence chain traversal: dispatch from 3 levels of fn nesting.
# f1 -> f2 -> f3, f3 calls [+] which dispatches via EffectPerform.
# The Addable Int instance must be found through 3 effect chain links.
[
  f3: [fn [let a b] [+ a b]]
  f2: [fn [let a b] [f3 a b]]
  f1: [fn [let a b] [f2 a b]]
  result: [f1 40 2]
]
=== out
["f3": [fn [let a b] ...]  "f2": [fn [let a b] ...]  "f1": [fn [let a b] ...]  "result": 42]
